","/arc-plc/wisconsin/portage-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 59% of normal in January to February and 184% in February to March. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 227% of normal. Grid 28963 had its driest year in 1958 at 61%.</p>"}
